1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:03,330
Everyone rebels at some point.

2
00:00:04,530 --> 00:00:06,700
Not as a child?
Then as an adult.

3
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:11,230
Not at work?
Then in love.

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:14,250
But it has to lead somewhere.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,400
That sounds results-driven.

6
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,700
What about the process?

7
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,600
The process? What nonsense.

8
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:22,800
Results matter more.
